# The Docker build context is the repo root. The root Dockerfile builds the
# web/ (Node SPA) and mcp/ (Python server) halves across four stages (two
# builders, a data-bake stage, and the runtime). We exclude everything else,
# plus the build artifacts that should not enter the image.

# --- Version control / CI ---
.git
.github

# --- Python caches / build artifacts (anywhere in the repo) ---
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/coverage.xml
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/.eggs

# --- Virtualenvs ---
.venv
**/.venv
**/venv

# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
mcp/.env
mcp/.env.local

# --- Test / fixture files (only mini_corpus fixture enters data-stage, never runtime) ---
mcp/tests/*
!mcp/tests/__init__.py
!mcp/tests/fixtures/
!mcp/tests/fixtures/**
mcp/tests/fixtures/**/__pycache__
chat/tests

# --- Large / transient data (keep manual YAML, ignore raw dumps + caches) ---
mcp/data/raw
mcp/data/hf_cache
mcp/data/cache

# --- Frontend build artifacts (rebuilt inside the image) ---
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
web/.git

# --- Other languages / OS ---
node_modules
**/node_modules
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
docs/_build/

# --- Local-only / session dirs (never in the image; .railway is tracked) ---
scratch
.remember
.superpowers
.playwright-mcp
.railway
**/.ingest-state
**/.audit-venv
docs